<title>USA: Delta and Pine authorizes 10 pct buy back.</title>
<headline>Delta and Pine authorizes 10 pct buy back.</headline>
<dateline>SCOTT, Miss. 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Delta and Pine Land Co said Monday that it board has authorized the repurchase of up to 10 percent of its common stock outstanding.</p>
<p>&quot;Our extraordinary capital investment program related to the introduction of transgenic cotton and soybean varieties has been basically completed. That accomplishment, along with the anticipation of a continuation of increased earnings, should provide free cash flow for the repurchase of common stock,&quot; said Roger Malkin, chairman and chief executive.</p>
</text>
